全球市场也都进入了畅销的纯电动车销量榜的前三。这就是5万元以下纯电动车型销量下降的主要因素。也就是说如今10万以下纯电动车市场，也只剩下五菱宏光MINIEV和奔腾小马能排上号了。'}, {'id': '20260822A03VFX00', 'articletype': '0', 'title': '全新比亚迪唐正式亮相，四季度上市，全面提升', 'pic_style': 2, 'publish_time': '2026-08-22 10:56:45', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oj7LxHU8pIFHGH-QDmVKml5ji13yBt_9LMG09MGEzRqfsAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oj7LxHU8pIFHGH-QDmVKml5ji13yBt_9LMG09MGEzRqfsAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oj7LxHU8pIFHGH-QDmVKml5ji13yBt_9LMG09MGEzRqfsAA_197130/0', 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O15eEAFvgQzn98YjAbQTMEUkQvVb-hKgCuDKz9aQaF_SUAA_197130/0', 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OS3L4wHgCoVbQPAaycBt_6ty6fg2RNcDl10xjh6TNT4XIAA_197130/0'], 'ls_img_exp_type': '3', 'ext': {'196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oj7LxHU8pIFHGH-QDmVKml5ji13yBt_9LMG09MGEzRqfsAA_196130/0', '360x240': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oj7LxHU8pIFHGH-QDmVKml5ji13yBt_9LMG09MGEzRqfsAA_360240/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oj7LxHU8pIFHGH-QDmVKml5ji13yBt_9LMG09MGEzRqfsAA_330330/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oj7LxHU8pIFHGH-QDmVKml5ji13yBt_9LMG09MGEzRqfsAA_8080/0', 'img_count': 5}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260822A03VFX00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260822A03VFX00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260822A03VFX00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260822A03VFX00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '10093212', 'chl_name': '波波车讯', 'icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/11334966892_200200/0', 'sicon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/11334966892_200200/0', 'mrk': '每天带来一手新车资讯', 'last_art_update': '1787400595', 'uin': 'ec24a80cd3ea091f28bc1b0fde2ae4f35c', 'encoded_suid': '8QIf3n5f74cYvzbZ7gM=', 'vip_type': '30011', 'vip_type_new': '30011', 'vip_desc': '汽车领域创作者', 'vip_icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14876048581/0', 'medal_info': {'type_id': 24, 'medal_id': 38, 'medal_level': 1, 'medal_name': '初露锋芒', 'medal_de